# derived schemas, retrieval artifacts, and semantic outputs in git.
data/external/dryad/
data/external/zenodo/

# NDP raw resource payloads are mutable external data; manifests, hashes,
# extracted schemas, and reports remain versioned.
data/experiments/ndp50_v1/resources/

# Local Chinese plan-comparison deliverables; the English versions are versioned.
docs/ndp50_plan_update_vs_pdf_2026-07-26_CN.md
